00:00:16.298 --> 00:00:18.657
WAS NEVER ANY QUESTION ABOUT

00:00:18.691 --> 00:00:20.344
WHO LEE HARVEY OSWALD WAS.

00:00:20.378 --> 00:00:21.692
HE WAS A PASSIONATE AND

00:00:21.693 --> 00:00:22.638
COMMITTED COMMUNIST.

00:00:22.639 --> 00:00:25.354
IN 1959, HE GAVE UP HIS

00:00:25.355 --> 00:00:27.911
AMERICAN PASSPORT AND DEFECTED

00:00:27.913 --> 00:00:30.420
TO THE SOVIET UNION WHERE HE

00:00:30.421 --> 00:00:32.070
MARRIED A RUSSIAN WOMAN AND

00:00:32.071 --> 00:00:32.980
LIVED IN MINESK.

00:00:33.015 --> 00:00:35.151
THEN HE RETURNED TO THIS

00:00:35.185 --> 00:00:37.365
COUNTRY AND BEGAN TO ATTEND

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:38.642
RALLIES FOR FIDEL CASTRO.

00:00:38.643 --> 00:00:40.475
THEN HE TRAVELED TO MEXICO

00:00:40.476 --> 00:00:41.756
CITY AND MET WITH THE K.G.B.

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:42.338
AGENTS THERE.

00:00:42.372 --> 00:00:44.847
A FEW MONTHS BEFORE IN DALLAS

00:00:44.848 --> 00:00:46.719
HE TRIED TO MURDER GENERAL

00:00:46.753 --> 00:00:48.539
EDWIN WALKER BECAUSE WALKER

00:00:48.573 --> 00:00:50.271
HAD GIVEN SPEECHES ATTACKING

00:00:50.272 --> 00:00:50.709
COMMUNISM.

00:00:50.743 --> 00:00:52.112
SO OSWALD NEVER HID HIS

00:00:52.146 --> 00:00:52.437
POLITICS.

00:00:52.471 --> 00:00:54.783
NOT FOR A MOMENT.

00:00:54.817 --> 00:00:56.565
HE TALKED INCESSANTLY ABOUT

00:00:56.566 --> 00:00:57.922
COMMUNISM TO ANYONE WHO WOULD

00:00:57.923 --> 00:00:58.468
LISTEN.

00:00:58.469 --> 00:01:00.141
BUT MANY AMERICANS NEVER

00:01:00.175 --> 00:01:01.377
REALLY UNDERSTOOD WHAT LEE

00:01:01.378 --> 00:01:02.879
HARVEY OSWALD BELIEVED AND

00:01:02.914 --> 00:01:04.236
THEY DIDN’T UNDERSTAND IT

00:01:04.238 --> 00:01:05.218
BECAUSE THE NEWS OUTLETS

00:01:05.253 --> 00:01:06.308
DIDN’T TELL THEM.

00:01:06.342 --> 00:01:07.637
ALMOST IMMEDIATELY, THE MEDIA

00:01:07.671 --> 00:01:08.880
BEGAN SPINNING A DIFFERENT

00:01:08.915 --> 00:01:09.737
STORY.

00:01:09.738 --> 00:01:11.078
PRESIDENT KENNEDY, THEY

00:01:11.079 --> 00:01:14.555
SUGGESTED, HAD BEEN MURDERED

00:01:14.589 --> 00:01:16.726
BY CONSERVATIVES, POSSIBLY BY

00:01:16.727 --> 00:01:18.154
CONSERVATISM ITSELF, BY HATE,

00:01:18.188 --> 00:01:20.326
AS THEY OFTEN PUT IT.

00:01:20.327 --> 00:01:21.463
THE EXPLANATION WAS NEVER

00:01:21.464 --> 00:01:22.589
PRECISE BUT THE IDEA WAS THE

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:23.354
SAME.

00:01:23.356 --> 00:01:25.610
RIGHT WINGERS KILLED KENNEDY.

00:01:25.612 --> 00:01:27.293
THE SOVIET UNION NATURALLY A

00:01:27.327 --> 00:01:29.791
SUSPECT IN THIS CRIME HAPPY TO

00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:31.926
AGREE WITH THE ASSESSMENT.

00:01:31.927 --> 00:01:34.304
AS A SOEV YACHT SPOKESMAN --

00:01:34.339 --> 00:01:36.118
SOVIET SPOKEMAN PUT IT THE

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.839
MORAL RESPONSIBILITY LAY WITH

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.624
"BARRY GOLDWATER AND OTHER

00:01:39.659 --> 00:01:41.683
