00:01:51.313 --> 00:01:52.798
JOHNSON IN LOPSIDED ELECTION.

00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:54.350
BY THAT TIME MANY AMERICANS

00:01:54.384 --> 00:01:55.526
ASSOCIATED GOLDWATER WITH

00:01:55.527 --> 00:01:56.019
